81:The lane law stands at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/controller-handoff">> #/the-lane-law and the swarm's at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/mixed-model-swarm">>: red-first per commit; no `git stash`; never `--no-verify`; a scratch `LAR_ROOT` per vessel and no global `LAR_BAGS`; a kill names its own pid; a push only while no CI run stands in flight on that branch; `node tools/ci-verdict.mjs --branch <b> --head <sha>` read after each push; `node tools/e2e-shards.mjs push <lane>`; `tools/witness-all.sh` before the handback; every touched package's whole suite over the built tree.
