/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/dreamdom-roadmap.mem:129:* ''Builds'': the ''Node CLI'' text camera over the port (`lares act … --yes` as acts, writes from files, asks for filters and renders); the ''SSR face'' (RootTemplate or a static template through the fakedom camera, links as real `href` routes, forms as writes or acts over the holder, a surface attaching for live mode); the ''MCP projection'' (resources ↔ keys with a cursor in the annotations, `subscribe` and `updated` ↔ `port:changes` without payload, `tools/call` per affordance kind, elicitation for the confirm road and `lar-field` schemas, `tools/list_changed` when the affordance set changes, the suite's `fault` names as the tool's error vocabulary); the ''Mudlet weekend'' (a loopback telnet listener in the node island with GMCP, NAWS and CHARSET negotiation and MCCP refused, the `Lar.*` package family mirroring the port kinds, chunking at ~2 KB with a `part/of` envelope, then the `lar.mpackage` with Geyser panes painted from `label-html` keys, a `Geyser.TextEdit` save round-tripping a `txId`, an affordance click invoking by id, a refusal painting an alert); later the proxy mode with GMCP tee (`Room.Info` and `Char.Items` to records, vitals to presence, the river to a log beside the island and never the CRDT); squads only after a wizard grant exists (a keyhive grant, per-character sockets, a reflex table, an intent verb, `squad/*` tiddlers, a game-visible tag, an audit log).
