/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:785:# ''The ceremony'', each line one act: a dress rehearsal alone with synthetic names; the old homes moved aside; the image pulled by digest and the manifest's addresses read aloud; each founds, writes the seed's card and reads it back; each unlocks; each opens a co-founding offer and hands it across; each joins on the fingerprint heard aloud and reads the AID aloud; each seals; each contracts by partial and cosign; each makes its faces and joins the shared realm; each wears a face in a tab, edits, and reads the other's edit; each restarts, unlocks and reads both again; the phones mint and scan; the cards go to two places.
