/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:848:# ''Guardians and recovery.'' The enrolment shape stands ruled (#/rulings). Guardian count and threshold at enrolment, request authentication, the veto, a person's death and succession, the catastrophe rite and any third key, and a Handle's DNS binding stand open at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/seed-and-nexus">>.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:849:# ''A sealed receipt manifest for carriage.'' It would let a root restored from paper re-open its carriage after device loss — and would turn carriage toward the backup W rules it never becomes. The lenses split; re-opening W needs the operator's turned key.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:850:# ''Carriage across leaves.'' A guest-held carry-claim proven at the carry door would let carriage follow a guest across leaves — a second relation and a second domain. Lean: not built.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:851:# ''The reading of "delegated keys" for cloud carriers'', deferred until the operator can deploy to a cloud surface (#/the-road).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:852:# ''House leans the operator may overturn'': the floor vessel key drops its next-key commitment; the long-silent device rule; the strangers' dial drops the newest arrival (#/decisions); the seal's standing leans (`S7` of #/the-loops).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:854:!!! Planes and offerings
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:855:# ''The offering's `offer` and `witness` caps'' against the Lamplighter stack.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:856:# ''The crossing record.'' Its durable emission threshold (lean: authority, vessel, federation and externally meaningful-effect boundaries alone), and whether a destination receipt always signs separately (lean: yes).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:857:# ''Engine cadence'': who holds a cadence share and the epoch pin stand ruled (#/rulings); whether partial conformance lands before `kahuli engine` un-holds (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/contract">>).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:858:# ''Grammar submissions'': whether the Nexus Kahu or the corpus-kahu receive them.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:859:# ''DNS custody past the credential'': delegated `_acme-challenge`, record custody, the ACME account and CAA travel as one question (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/bounded-reach-contract">>). With it: whether a host timer or a hand runs renewal, and the answer for a phone that forces encrypted DNS.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:860:# ''The crossroads mirror's filter'' (`G21` of #/the-loops).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:861:# ''Removal's reach.'' The model stands ruled (#/rulings; <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/kapae#/four-edges">>). Five questions stay the operator's, each with the house's lean. Whether an edge act may ever use the emergency class (lean: never). Whether a seated member under a member shadow keeps a seat's signature until the next roll (lean: yes, a seat leaves by a roll alone). What a recovery council holds after a mutual removal (lean: nothing built; the fork stands as the one exit). Whether a holder's key reads at its log's current head, so a recovered face keeps its edges (lean: yes, owed with the resolver of #/side-lanes). Whether a counted raise moves the keys while a lift still races it (lean: yes, remove-wins reaches the keys, and a lift then seats afresh). Two more came with the key side. What removes a seat no standing hand can revoke, the founding vessel's own among them (lean: a fresh group, at the re-founding that moves the PersonaGroup to a Keyhive group). Whether a vessel that holds no revoke authority goes on trying a raise until it sees the seat leave (lean: yes, and each try hands the roll on again, so the content key rolls whoever revokes the seat).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:862:# ''The self-slot inner ring.'' Wiring it freezes a naming: a bag URL through a live ring hashes to seed its document, and a re-name costs a re-founding. Lean: widen the bridge first, and wire the ring on an explicit ruling alone.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:864:!!! Shore, grammar and code
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:865:# ''The ungated slot child.'' A slot child's native save never grades; three child-edit shapes stand marked as the operator's call (`packages/lararium-tw5/tests/meme-backstop.test.ts`; <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/syncer-back-parity">>).
