/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:867:# ''The capture cell'' sits apart for review in `packages/lararium-mesh/src/capture/`, `packages/lararium-node/src/capture/`, `packages/lararium-tw5/src/capture/` and `packages/lares-cli/src/commands/capture/`. Canon places capture in Python per stream with the TS daemon coordinating alone (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/capture-annotation-model">>), while the TS cell carries the live path. Rule: retire it to Python, or re-home it.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:868:# ''Receipt names and verb capabilities.'' Whether a receipt's address follows the house's own kind nouns or the content-addressed surface; and the table that maps each routed verb to its capability, where `deriveRoutedCap` answers for every routed verb today (`packages/lararium-tw5/src/verb-local-dispatch.ts`).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:869:# ''Rulings that rest in their own carriers'': the promotion receipt's fields (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/canon-boundary">>), the one-of-one mantle (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/handle-card">>), the lease's questions (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/realm-bag-brief">>), and the offering's questions (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/heraldry">>).
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:870:# ''Two Kairoses.'' The fiction names KAIROS as a watcher that speaks unasked; the code's Kairos pet-names an unbuilt entity that refreshes an OAuth grant at the right moment (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/reach-plane">>). One entity, or two that share a name?
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:871:# ''Alerts and shadows.'' Whether a disk conflict that arrives while no wiki stands pinned raises its alert at the next pin; whether a hand that deletes its override of a shadow leaves a delete, where today the shadow's text gets saved as a record; whether the page warns when a browser has joined no face.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:872:# ''The confirm door upstream.'' The fork asks its questions through the wiki itself (`$tw.utils.confirm`, `tm-confirm`). Owed before a donation: the order of actions after a confirm, a switch for a blocking prompt, and one squashed change. The withdrawn render boundary's upstream pull request, if it still stands open, advertises a design the fork backed out.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:873:# ''One sentence for the `CLAUDE.md` adapter note'', the operator's to place: the CLI's ingest, watch and REPACK derive against `LAR_BAGS` and `LAR_WIKIS`, so "read neither" holds for the daemon's projection mirrors alone.

